using StateSystem

~ store_exit_prompt
Narrator: The door swings open. Cold air hits your face.\n⌈The rain has stopped.⌋\nA bridge stretches across the dark canal ahead.
- Walk toward the bridge.
	=> END
- Stand in the doorway a moment longer.
	do StateSystem.apply_choice({"will": -0.3})
	=> store_exit_stand

~ store_exit_stand
Narrator: The night stretches out. Somewhere, a dog barks.\nThe bridge waits.
- Walk toward the bridge.
	=> END
- ...
	do StateSystem.apply_choice({"hope_despair": -1})
	=> store_exit_stand_go

~ store_exit_stand_go
Narrator: You push off the doorframe. The bridge is your only way forward.
- Go.
	=> END
